# Candidate summary — S014172

Added `src/include/linux/kern_levels.rs` with mandatory immutable provenance.
It maps all selected source macros from `include/linux/kern_levels.h`:

- `KERN_SOH`, `KERN_EMERG` through `KERN_DEBUG`, `KERN_DEFAULT`, and
  `KERN_CONT` preserve their exact string bytes. `KERN_SOH_ASCII` preserves
  the C character literal's `int` value and expression type.
- `LOGLEVEL_SCHED` through `LOGLEVEL_DEBUG` preserve each signed C `int`
  value as `core::ffi::c_int`.

No symbols outside the leased destination or task evidence were changed.
